4.74707978522868,"y":99.87450158895362,"text":"1.001\n.999","leader":null},{"id":"npyi5mm2","x":35.74790500320958,"y":18.808251734806483,"text":"EXERCISE 3.7 / PDF178 / 3-50\nStacked upper/lower limit dimension in inches.\nMaximum1.001; minimum.999.\nTotal tolerance1.001-.999=.002in.\nEquivalent symmetric variation±.001in.\nCylinder side projection; length unspecified.","leader":null},{"id":"n0b6y1ab","x":235.91147145266046,"y":18.808251734806483,"text":"EXERCISE 3.8 / PDF178 / 3-50\nThree common tolerance types:\n1. Limit.\n2. Bilateral.\n3. Unilateral.\nLimit values directly show maximum/minimum.","leader":null},{"id":"n67maxp6","x":235.91147145266046,"y":88.8655019357284,"text":"EXERCISE 3.9 / PDF178 / 3-50\nSource rows top-to-bottom:\n1. Symbol absent: unresolved in supplied PDF.\n2. Counterbore.\n3. Diameter.\n4. Damaged V/dots: identity unresolved.","leader":null},{"id":"npis9ccz","x":235.91147145266046,"y":148.91456798333544,"text":"SOURCE SYMBOL QUALIFICATION\nBlank/damaged rows are not recoverable answers.\nDo not invent a glyph or certified row order.\nRow2/3 follow the visible source forms.\nKnown glossary symbols are separate evidence.\nRecheck against a legible source if provided.","leader":null},{"id":"no8lsda9","x":35.74790500320958,"y":178.93911072520953,"text":"MANUAL WORKSHEET QUALIFICATION\nThe limit applies to the source1.000 diameter.\nPaper rectangle and arrowheads are native annotations.\nNo associative CAD dimension or tolerance driver.\nNo unspecified physical cylinder length invented.\nThe source requests a total tolerance of.002in.","leader":null}],"primitives":[{"id":"pdft41xr","type":"polyline","points":[{"x":55,"y":95},{"x":135,"y":95},{"x":135,"y":115},{"x":55,"y":115},{"x":55,"y":95}],"style":"outline"},{"id":"prwusuy7","type":"line","points":[{"x":49.764253873698195,"y":104.8736958071139},{"x":139.83786266317932,"y":104.8736958071139}],"style":"center"},{"id":"pjz5n2pd","type":"line","points":[{"x":39.75607943845389,"y":94.8655019357